{"id":"631297","name":"空心麻团","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/631297/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"180克(100度)"},{"name":"糖","amount":"60克"},{"name":"无铝泡打粉","amount":"3克(不喜欢的可以不加)"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆沙","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大碗中加入糖。","img":"images/631297/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入180克开水。","img":"images/631297/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"化开。","img":"images/631297/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入糯米粉。","img":"images/631297/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加10克油，揉匀。","img":"images/631297/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加泡打粉(不喜欢的也可以不加)，揉成光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜，室温松弛20分钟。","img":"images/631297/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出面团，分成均匀的10等分。","img":"images/631297/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取出一个小剂子，包入豆沙。","img":"images/631297/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"滚上白芝麻。","img":"images/631297/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次团圆，麻团生胚就好了。","img":"images/631297/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/631297/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油三成热时，下入麻团生胚。","img":"images/631297/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"随着油温慢慢升高，稍微定型后，用漏勺轻轻按压麻团，使其膨胀，受热均匀。","img":"images/631297/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"全程小火，炸至麻团浮起。","img":"images/631297/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"稍微开大一点火，使其上色。","img":"images/631297/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/631297/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/631297/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631297/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631297/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"个个空心，尝尝哦。","img":"images/631297/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}